# Rules for RAG Project

- Use LangChain best practices (v0.2+).
- Prefer 'langchain-ollama' for local LLM integration.
- When working with ChromaDB, always ensure collection persistence is handled.
- Use Pydantic v2 syntax for data models.
- Always include type hints in Python functions.
- If you find any deprecated LangChain imports, suggest the updated version.
- Explain the logic behind RAG retrieval steps (Query Transformation, Re-ranking, etc.) when modifying code.
